{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "core",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# Wyrdwood\nAn **original** 3D survival and building game for 1 to 10 players, built on **Lunaris** to find what the engine lacks (like Caldera did).\n\nSeeded archipelago, five Wardens, bases that must stand, stamina fights, boats, weather.\n\nPlan file: `examples/wyrdwood/PLAN.md`",
   "x": -320,
   "y": -90,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "status",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Where it stands (2026-10-15)\n- Plan written and committed.\n- **Character motion done**: swim, wade, roll, ladders, ledge pull-up (`CharacterMotion`, `Climbable`) and the three Caldera traps fixed (characters report contacts, a `Steer` walks a character, a `Probe` gives scripts the ground and a ray). 12 new tests; every old test, the 51 golden scenes and the 51 playtests unchanged.\n- **World generation** from a seed: Gaea landform + Tellus detail and tiles, biomes, start, altars, camps (`tools/gen_wyrdwood.py`). **The sky**: a 25-minute day, a moonlit night, six kinds of weather.\n- Next: vegetation streaming, rain, crafting and inventory, building, combat (M1 to M3).\n- **This board is the editor's Canvas tab** (`lunaris-editor --canvas examples/wyrdwood/wyrdwood.canvas`): it reads Obsidian's canvas files and follows the file when it is saved, so the plan stays on screen while the work goes on.",
   "x": 400,
   "y": -90,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "g_pillars",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "The five pillars",
   "x": -1480,
   "y": -420,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 640,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**1. Build anywhere, and it has to stand**\nPieces snap; wood and stone carry weight; a wall with nothing under it falls. A base is a place you made.",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": -360,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**2. Stamina fights**\nSwing, block, parry, roll. Every blow costs breath. A big animal teaches you to wait.",
   "x": -970,
   "y": -360,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**3. The land is the progression**\nNo levels. A region is a wall until you own the tool that opens it.",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": -160,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**4. A world that looks like weather**\nFog in valleys, a low red sun, rain on water, firelight on timber. The GPU renderer is the art direction.",
   "x": -970,
   "y": -160,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**5. Together, loosely**\n1 to 10 players who may come and go; alone is a full game.",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 40,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "g_world",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "The world: regions gate your tools (a Warden sleeps in each)",
   "x": -300,
   "y": -1250,
   "width": 2780,
   "height": 560,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Meadow**\ngreen hills, birches, berries, deer, boars\n+ wood, stone, flint, hide\n! boars, crows\nWarden: the **Moss Colossus**",
   "x": -270,
   "y": -1180,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Gloomwood**\ndense old fir, blue light, mist\n+ bog ore, resin, strong timber\n! wolves, bark-skinned stalkers\nWarden: the **Thornmother**",
   "x": 185,
   "y": -1180,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Moor**\nswamp, rain, rotten water, ruins\n+ peat iron, reeds, bones\n! leeches, mire hounds, sickness\nWarden: the **Drowned Jarl**",
   "x": 640,
   "y": -1180,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Crag**\nmountain, snow, cold that hurts\n+ silver, ice stone\n! frost wolves, cold, rockfall\nWarden: the **Rime Wyrm**",
   "x": 1095,
   "y": -1180,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Barrens**\nash plains, cinder wind\n+ black iron, fire stone\n! raiders, ash storms\nWarden: the **Cinder King**",
   "x": 1550,
   "y": -1180,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Sea**\nopen water between the islands\n+ fish, wrecks, new islands\n! storms, sea beasts\nno Warden",
   "x": 2005,
   "y": -1180,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 230,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r_end",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**The end**: light all five beacons and the road home appears.   **How the world is made**: Tellus (our terrain tool) writes the height tiles, splat pictures, water and forests; Lunaris loads them with `Terrain` + `TerrainLayers` + `WaterBody` + `scatter`. One seed, the same world on every machine.",
   "x": 520,
   "y": -930,
   "width": 1200,
   "height": 150,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "loop",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## The loop\n\n**gather** (wood, stone, fibre, berries)\n↓\n**craft** at a station\n↓\n**build** a base, cook, rest\n↓\n**explore** a new region\n↓\n**meet its Warden**\n↓\nbetter tools → next region",
   "x": -1480,
   "y": -1250,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 700,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "g_sys",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Systems and where the engine stands today",
   "x": -1480,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 3000,
   "height": 900
  },
  {
   "id": "sys_have",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Have (in the engine now)\n- Terrain, materials, water, floating (`Terrain`, `TerrainLayers`, `WaterBody`, `Buoyant`)\n- **Swim, wade, roll, ladders, ledge pull-up** (`CharacterMotion`, `Climbable`: new, 2026-10-15)\n- Third-person camera with collision (`CameraRig`, `CameraCollide`)\n- Creature parts: `Steer`, `Sensor`, `BehaviorTree`, navigation, spawners\n- Day and night, fog, weather look (`TimeOfDay`, `HeightFog`, GPU high)\n- UI kit v3: bars, drag-and-drop slots, menus\n- Audio mixer; tools: playtests, golden hashes, `profile`",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 940,
   "height": 800,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "sys_part",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Part (exists, not enough)\n- Big world: `StreamZone` streams prefabs; **terrain tile streaming is new**\n- Forests at a distance: instanced meshes exist; occlusion and LOD to measure\n- Combat: `HitPoints`, `Sensor`, contacts; the rules are game content\n- Items and inventory: UI slots exist; item data and rules new\n- Boats: floating exists; a boat controller is new\n- Characters you see: skinned `.glb` works; retargeting and morph targets new\n- Multiplayer: lockstep and rollback to 16 players; **no drop-in**\n- Saves: scenes and snapshots; world-changes save new",
   "x": -450,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 940,
   "height": 800,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "sys_new",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## New (to build)\n- **Building with a support graph** (the core of the game)\n- **Destruction**: fell a tree, break a rock, pieces and sound\n- Crafting and stations (spatial query + recipes)\n- Survival loop: food buffs, rest, cold and wet\n- **Snapshot join** for the network (state at tick N + the log)\n- Foot IK on slopes (presentation only)\n- Runtime world generation from a seed (Tellus tiles)",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 940,
   "height": 800,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "g_ms",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Milestones: each ends with something you can play, a playtest, and screenshots",
   "x": -1480,
   "y": 1280,
   "width": 4040,
   "height": 600,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "m1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M1 Shore**\n400 m island; walk, run, swim, roll; day and night; fell trees, mine rocks; hotbar, inventory; workbench, axe, hammer; one boar",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M2 Hearth**\nBuild a house from snapping pieces that has to stand; door, fire, bed; rest and cook; save and load",
   "x": -950,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M3 Blood**\nStamina combat with sword, shield, block, parry; boars, wolves, deer; hurt, heal, eat; the first Warden",
   "x": -450,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M4 Wood**\nThe whole island with Meadow and Gloomwood from a seed; thousands of trees; streaming; the second Warden",
   "x": 50,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M5 Together**\n2 to 4 players on a host, one joining mid-game",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M6 Sail**\nBuild a boat, sail to a second island with a Moor",
   "x": 1050,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M7 Mountain and ash**\nCrag and Barrens, the last three Wardens, the beacon ending",
   "x": 1550,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M8 Polish**\nMenus, settings, controller, sound, map, 60 fps on the weakest machine tested",
   "x": 2050,
   "y": 1460,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 220,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "m0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**M0 (done)**: the plan. **First target = M1 to M3, the game's first hour.** M4 and M5 are what make it a real engine test (scale and multiplayer); the rest is content on a finished foundation.",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 1330,
   "width": 3900,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "g_eng",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Engine work, in order, and which milestone waits for it",
   "x": -1480,
   "y": 1930,
   "width": 4040,
   "height": 560,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "w1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**1. Character toolkit**\nswim, wade, roll, ladders, ledges and the three Caldera traps (contacts, `Steer`, `Probe`): DONE.\nLeft: foot IK (presentation only)",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "w2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**2. Destruction**\nfelling, breaking rocks, pieces, sound. Cloth waits (sails can be vertex-animated)",
   "x": -890,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "w3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**3. 3D performance + tile streaming**\ninstancing at forest scale, occlusion, LOD, measured with `profile`",
   "x": -330,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "w4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**4. Building support graph**\nas game scripts first; into the engine if 2,000 pieces measure too slow",
   "x": 230,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "w5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**5. Snapshot join**\nfor the network: a player joins mid-game",
   "x": 790,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "w6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**6. Morph targets + retargeting**\nwhen equipment on bodies is wanted",
   "x": 1350,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "w7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**7. gpu `high.rs` hang**\nwhenever it blocks",
   "x": 1910,
   "y": 1990,
   "width": 530,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "rules",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**What I will not claim**: that the Wardens, regions or two kilometres exist before they are played and photographed; that combat or building feels good because it works (every playtest note goes in `docs/DOGFOOD_WYRDWOOD.md`, bad parts included); that multiplayer works until two real windows on two machines finish a session with the same state hash.",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 2270,
   "width": 3900,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "g_parity",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "As close to the reference game as possible: feel, structure and systems, never its names, models, sounds, lore or code (the user's order, 2026-10-15)",
   "x": -1480,
   "y": 2520,
   "width": 4040,
   "height": 760,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Camera and controls**\nthird person behind the shoulder, mouse look, scroll zoom, a first-person toggle; walk, run, jump, sneak, roll with grace frames. **M1**",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 2600,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Survival**\nhealth + stamina, three foods at a time (no hunger bar), rested bonus at a fire and a bed, wet and cold. **M2-M3**",
   "x": -450,
   "y": 2600,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Gathering**\na felled tree falls over and leaves a stump; boulders break into stones; pick up flint, berries, mushrooms. **M1**",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 2600,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Building**\nhammer menu, snapping pieces, workbench must be near and under a roof, stations grow with what is built beside them. **M2**",
   "x": 1550,
   "y": 2600,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Structural integrity**\nblue / green / yellow / red by support, unsupported pieces fall, rain rots open timber, a fire needs smoke to leave. **M2**",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 2820,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Combat**\nweapon types, bow with a draw, shield block and parry, backstab, stagger; durability and repair. **M3**",
   "x": -450,
   "y": 2820,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Creatures**\nskittish deer, boars you can tame, wolf packs, night monsters; flee, aggro, sleep, drops. **M3**",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 2820,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Bosses and biomes**\nfive altars with offerings, a power each; rings of biomes gated by gear and metal. **M3-M7**",
   "x": 1550,
   "y": 2820,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**World and weather**\nhalf-hour day, mist, rain, storms, snow; map that fills as you walk, pins; portals; tombstone run. **M1-M5**",
   "x": -1450,
   "y": 3040,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Sailing**\nraft, boat, ship: oars, sails, wind, sea monsters. **M6**",
   "x": -450,
   "y": 3040,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Skills**\nrunning, swimming, axes, bows rise with use. **M3**",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 3040,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**The look**\nlow-detail models and textures under beautiful light: fog, bloom, shafts, shadows, one grade per hour. **every milestone**",
   "x": 1550,
   "y": 3040,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  }
 ],
